### Dashboard API Tests
### Replace placeholders before running.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_SCHOOL_SCOPED_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@source = attendance
@severity = warning
@eventType = attendance.session.submit
@actorType = admin
@dateFrom = 2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z
@dateTo = 2026-12-31T23:59:59.999Z
@cursor = REPLACE_WITH_NEXT_CURSOR

### Dashboard Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Alerts - Default
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Alerts - Include zero-count alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts?includeZeroCount=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Alerts - By source
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts?source={{source}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Alerts - By severity
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts?severity={{severity}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Alerts - Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Alerts - Source, severity, and zero count
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts?source={{source}}&severity={{severity}}&includeZeroCount=true&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Activity Feed - Default
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Activity Feed - By source
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?source={{source}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Activity Feed - By event type
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?eventType={{eventType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Activity Feed - By actor type
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?actorType={{actorType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Activity Feed - Date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?dateFrom={{dateFrom}}&dateTo={{dateTo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Activity Feed - Limited page
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard Activity Feed - Cursor page
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?cursor={{cursor}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Negative - Summary without token should fail
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary

### Negative - Alerts invalid source should fail validation
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts?source=invalid_source
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Negative - Alerts invalid severity should fail validation
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts?severity=urgent
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Negative - Activity feed invalid event type should fail validation
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?eventType=invalid
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Negative - Activity feed invalid date range should fail validation
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?dateFrom=2026-12-31T00:00:00.000Z&dateTo=2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Negative - Activity feed invalid cursor should fail validation
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed?cursor=not-a-valid-cursor
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Non-goal - Alert read route should not exist
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts/example-alert/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Non-goal - Alert dismiss route should not exist
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts/example-alert/dismiss
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Non-goal - Activity feed pin route should not exist
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity-feed/audit-example/pin
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
